# Derived by hand from Semantics ch. 4 and 8: the block is one binding group, so the door's first value is asked at the build with `$called`'s initial value, "front", and the plain `let` reads the value `@Word "x"` ends on; the hold and `@Word` take no position, so the places are the door, the label and the button, in page order.
